      "id": "overview",
      "title": "## Overview",
      "content": "This plan outlines the creation of 'NegOne', a modern, minimalist, and feminine AI-powered web application designed for girls and women. It integrates fitness, psychology, self-love, and healthy living guidance, featuring personalized AI-driven insights, progress tracking, and a calming aesthetic."
    },
    {
      "id": "key-features",
      "title": "## Key features",
      "content": "- **User Authentication**: Allows users to sign up and log in using their Gmail account.\n- **User Profile Setup**: Collects user data including height, weight, fitness goals (weight loss/maintenance/muscle gain), exercise frequency and duration, focus body areas, and body shape type.\n- **AI-Powered BMI Calculation & Categorization**: Automatically calculates and categorizes the user's Body Mass Index based on provided height and weight.\n- **AI-Powered Calorie & Water Intake Recommendation**: Calculates daily calorie needs and suggests optimal daily water intake, with tracking functionality.\n- **Personalized YouTube Exercise Link Generation**: Provides curated YouTube links for exercises tailored to the user's body shape, goals, and chosen focus areas.\n- **Healthy Recipes & Snacks Display**: Offers low-calorie recipe and snack ideas based on the user's daily calorie requirements, including ingredients, instructions, and potential video links.\n- **Daily Progress Tracking**: Enables users to log daily exercise completion, water intake, a short mental note (up to 140 characters), and current weight.\n- **Calendar System for Progress Visualization**: Stores daily logged information in a color-coded calendar view.\n- **Weight Progress Line Chart**: Displays a visual representation of the user's weight progress over multiple weeks or months.\n- **Dashboard Overview**: Presents a consolidated view of all progress, including calendar, weight, and exercise performance upon login.\n- **About NegOne Section**: Explains the meaning of the name 'NegOne' and its symbolism, connects the name to 'Nogon' (green) for psychological symbolism, and introduces the project team with bios and pastel design.\n- **UI & Aesthetic Customization**: Ensures a responsive, minimalist, and feminine interface with white UI/background, pale pink/baby pink/purple design elements, soft light green accents, rounded corners, soft shadows, calming animations, and clear text presentation.",
